261112 - Binary protocol TCP record layer (vscp_binary_handle_record, vscp_binary_wrap_record) with
         optional authenticated encryption (vscp_binary_set_authentication, AES + HMAC-SHA-256),
         compatible with the VSCP helper library TCP client.

261112 - Library version year.month.patch in src/vscp-firmware-version.h, updated automatically on
         every push to master (patch counts pushes in the month) by the Update version workflow.

261112 - VSCP_FWHLP_CRYPTO_SMALL_FOOTPRINT for 8-bit targets: smaller SHA-256 stack, no malloc in
         the built in AES and authenticated frame code, cached HMAC key state
         (VSCP_FWHLP_CRYPTO_NO_HMAC_CACHE, VSCP_FWHLP_CRYPTO_MAX_FRAME_SIZE).

261112 - Added authenticated binary frames (version 1, AES-CBC + HMAC-SHA-256, built in SHA-256)
         compatible with the VSCP helper library. Fixed the CRC of command/reply frames (was
         calculated over the not yet written CRC bytes). CLASS2.MEASUREMENT_FLOAT decoded MSB first.


260219 - Documented vscp_fwhlp_parseStringValue parsing semantics (0x/0/0b and endptr behavior) in helper docs and README indexes.

220123 - Added handling of firmware code added i spec 1.13.
200508 - vscp_initbtncnt increased to 16-bit (1.6.3)
